    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730302062438\" id=\"item-67224d239f15702a2f72da30\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-5746cecf9d0989da352b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans, and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Three cozy and well-lit bedrooms offering ample space for rest and rejuvenation, each finished with fine detailing and built to enhance the quality of your relaxation.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathroom:</strong> A sleek, modern bathroom equipped with high-end fixtures and a clean, minimalist design, creating a spa-like environment right at home.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Room:</strong> An expansive living area that serves as the heart of the home, featuring large windows that flood the space with natural light and offer stunning views of the surrounding landscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen:</strong> A state-of-the-art kitchen with contemporary appliances, ample cabinetry, and a layout that makes cooking and entertaining a breeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> A convenient single-car garage provides additional storage and secure parking, keeping your vehicle safe from the elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living:</strong> The property includes a landscaped garden and a patio area perfect for outdoor dining or enjoying the peaceful Niseko environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Constructed with attention to quality and sustainability, this property in New Zealand is perfect for anyone looking to combine the tranquility of Auckland with the conveniences of modern living. Whether you're a family looking for a peaceful retreat or a professional seeking a serene escape from the bustle of city life, this home is sure to impress.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;67224d979ad1a56c5d39bdce&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;67224d979ad1a56c5d39bdce&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730258888192_661154\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <di